ands of small-bowel frames by eye. An ensemble of 10 EfficientNet-B2 models (5 folds × 2 seeds) at the native 320 px finds lesions in 7 classes, grades severity in 4 tiers and draws a heat-map over each lesion.","url":"#p-crohnsight","repo":"https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/Crohn-Disease-Early-Prediction"},{"id":"agentic-rag","name":"Enterprise Agentic RAG Orchestrator","kind":"Multi-agent LLM system","year":"2026","metric":{"value":"0.81","label":"RAGAS faithfulness"},"stack":["LangGraph","LangChain","FastAPI","Qdrant","BM25","Redis","Next.js","RAGAS"],"summary":"Enterprise questions mix document lookups, database queries and actions such as sending email. A LangGraph Supervisor → Worker → Validator graph routes each query to Corrective RAG, NL-to-SQL, a human-in-the-loop email tool or chat.","url":"#p-agentic-rag","repo":"https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/Multi-Agent-RAG"},{"id":"openenv","name":"OpenEnv Data-Cleaning Agent","kind":"Reinforcement learning environment","year":"2026","metric":{"value":"0.967","label":"PPO grader score on hard-clean"},"stack":["OpenEnv","Stable-Baselines3 PPO","Llama 3.1 8B","Pydantic","FastAPI","Docker","HF Spaces"],"summary":"Cleaning a messy table takes many small, ordered decisions. An OpenEnv environment over pandas tables with reproducible (task, seed) episodes and a hidden clean ground truth.","url":"#p-openenv","repo":"https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/open-env-nuclei"},{"id":"student-xai","name":"Explainable Student Performance","kind":"MLOps + explainability","year":"2026","metric":{"value":"9","label":"models benchmarked, explained with SHAP + LIME"},"stack":["scikit-learn","XGBoost","CatBoost","LightGBM","PyTorch","SHAP","LIME","MLflow","Docker"],"summary":"A model that predicts which students will struggle is only useful if teachers can see why it made each prediction. Pandera-validated data and a ColumnTransformer pipeline feed a benchmark of 9 models: linear, tree ensembles, XGBoost, CatBoost, LightGBM, a PyTorch MLP, a PyTorch LSTM and FLAML AutoML.","url":"#p-student-xai","repo":"https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/student-performance-platform"},{"id":"dcgan","name":"DCGAN Reproducibility+","kind":"Generative vision research","year":"2026","metric":{"value":"5","label":"stability fixes over the 2015 paper, each documented"},"stack":["PyTorch","LSGAN","Spectral Norm","Matplotlib","Jupyter"],"summary":"The 2015 DCGAN is famously unstable, and most re-implementations show only a grid of blurry samples, never what the networks learned inside. Keeps Radford et al.'s all-convolutional architecture but swaps in an LSGAN loss, Spectral Normalization, a Xavier/Kaiming initialisation, discriminator dropout and label smoothing.","url":"#p-dcgan","repo":"https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/Modern-DCGAN-Reproducibility"}],"experience":[{"id":"hnnoix","role":"Research & Innovation Intern","org":"HNNOIX India Private Limited","kind":"Internship","when":"May 2026 – Jul 2026","points":["Worked on 6G research and development: network architectures, AI agents and communication systems.","Built reusable AI components (an LLM Gateway, a RAG Runtime, an AI Memory Layer and a Knowledge Base) for scalable agent execution, context management and workflow orchestration.","Applied generative AI, LLM, RAG and agent-based methods to decision-making, context-aware retrieval and workflow automation for 6G network architectures."],"url":"#x-hnnoix"},{"id":"freelance","role":"Freelance Financial AI Engineer","org":"Quantitative Investment Analysis","kind":"Freelance","when":"Dec 2024 – Jun 2025","points":["Built 2 autonomous trading-signal systems with agentic AI and RAG that read market news, extract sentiment and emit structured signals in real time.","Cut false-positive trade signals by 37% with filtering rules and confidence scoring.","Built a CrewAI research pipeline on GPT-4, the Bloomberg API, Financial Modeling Prep and Alpha Vantage for automated earnings analysis."],"url":"#x-freelance"}],"certifications":[{"name